Wed Oct 28 07:08:40 UTC 2026 - Priyanka Saggu <priyanka.saggu@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.37.2:
  * Bump images and versions to Go 1.26.10 and update distroless-iptables
  * upgrade .go-version to 1.26.10
  * hack: match OpenSSL 3.5 CN=127.0.0.1 output in client cert check
  * apiserver: accept large identity header sets with Go 1.27
  * dra: include extended resource claims in pod claim iteration and taint eviction
  * job controller: simplify recreation regression test
  * job controller: extend recreation regression coverage
  * job controller: clear expectations when deleting Job
  * Don't set nf_conntrack_max if it's already larger than needed
  * Move hashsize parameter setting out of SetMax
  * Move detectNumCPU() into conntrackConfigurer interface

- Update .spec file to bump go version build requirements:
  * `BuildRequires:  go >= 1.26.10`
  * ref: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/v1.37.2/.go-version

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Sep 28 05:55:18 UTC 2026 - Priyanka Saggu <priyanka.saggu@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.37.1:
  * Bump images and versions to go 1.26.8 and distroless iptables
  * Refuse UNC symlink targets in Windows subPath resolution
  * Restore only .spec part from ControllerRevision for any StatefulSet
  * fix: make nil DeviceTaintSelector match no devices
  * DRA: avoid integer overflow in per-claim device-limit checks
  * e2e auth: use unprivileged container port in projected podcertificate test
  * fix job pod could not be removed while removing finalizer failed
  * Guard against load balancers without port mappings
  * Avoid leaking node-specific kubelet config into the ConfigMap

- Update .spec file to bump go version build requirements:
  * `BuildRequires:  go >= 1.26.8`
  * ref: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/v1.37.1/.go-version

